# W27, guest b (k9: k5 fell on stag0101's rock slope on the way to matz00): joins a, goes into dng101b1 (a stage group of its own in a's instance); a's game over ends the
# instance: b goes home on its own story.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log b joined a
follow 40 until sealed>=600
explore matz00 yes until stage=dng101b1,control
log b in the cave
wander 0 0 30 until stage=stagml11,control fail epoch>=@700
log b home
